    "text": "Thank you for the onboarding details. For security reasons, I prefer to submit my personal information (National ID, date of birth, bank account) through Nordico’s official Workday portal accessed via the Nordico website or a verified internal link. Could you please confirm the correct, official onboarding URL or direct me to the appropriate section within the Nordico applicant portal? Once verified, I will promptly complete the required fields."
  }
}", "{
