    "report": "Checked inbox and found a follow-up from Nordico Recruiter regarding onboarding for the Editor position (J47). Advised user to verify the onboarding link due to safety concerns (domain mismatch). Replied to the recruiter requesting confirmation of the official onboarding URL before submitting personal data. No further actions needed at this time."
  }
}"]

